\itemize{
\item \code{ripd(default)}: Default method for a data frame \code{x} containing item metadata.

\item \code{ripd(est_irt)}: Method for an object of class \code{est_irt} created by
\code{\link[=est_irt]{est_irt()}}. The response data and the scaling factor \code{D} are taken from
the object.

\item \code{ripd(est_item)}: Method for an object of class \code{est_item} created by
\code{\link[=est_item]{est_item()}}. The response data, ability estimates, and the scaling
factor \code{D} are taken from the object.

}}
\section{Methods (by generic)}{
\itemize{
